### Send Email with Attachments

Source: https://github.com/resend/resend-node/blob/canary/_autodocs/types.md

Examples demonstrating how to send emails with attachments from disk, remote URLs, or inline content.

```typescript
import fs from 'fs';

const { data } = await resend.emails.send({
  from: 'sender@example.com',
  to: 'recipient@example.com',
  subject: 'Invoice',
  html: '<p>Invoice attached</p>',
  attachments: [
    {
      filename: 'invoice.pdf',
      content: fs.readFileSync('invoices/123.pdf'),
    },
  ],
});
```

```typescript
const { data } = await resend.emails.send({
  from: 'sender@example.com',
  to: 'recipient@example.com',
  subject: 'Report',
  html: '<p>Report attached</p>',
  attachments: [
    {
      filename: 'report.pdf',
      path: 'https://example.com/reports/2024.pdf',
    },
  ],
});
```

```typescript
const { data } = await resend.emails.send({
  from: 'sender@example.com',
  to: 'recipient@example.com',
  subject: 'Newsletter',
  html: '<img src="cid:logo" alt="Logo" />',
  attachments: [
    {
      filename: 'logo.png',
      content: logoBuffer,
      contentId: 'logo',
    },
  ],
});
```

--------------------------------

### Response Checking Pattern

Source: https://github.com/resend/resend-node/blob/canary/_autodocs/errors.md

Recommended approach using the returned error object from the SDK to handle API-level errors gracefully.

```typescript
const { data, error } = await resend.emails.send({
  from: 'sender@example.com',
  to: 'recipient@example.com',
  subject: 'Test',
  html: '<p>Test</p>',
});

if (error) {
  console.error(`[${error.name}] ${error.message}`);
  return;
}

console.log('Email sent:', data.id);
```

--------------------------------

### Response type (returned data/error shape)

Source: https://github.com/resend/resend-node/blob/canary/src/interfaces.ts

Generic Response<T> type returned by every SDK method. On success: { data: T, error: null } with the success shape (object: 'event', event: string). On error: { error: { message, statusCode, name }, data: null }. Always includes headers.

```typescript
export type Response<T> = (
  | {
      data: T;
      error: null;
    }
  | { error: ErrorResponse; data: null }
) & {
  headers: Record<string, string> | null;
};

export type ErrorResponse = {
  message: string;
  statusCode: number | null;
  name: RESEND_ERROR_CODE_KEY;
};
```

--------------------------------

### Email Send Options (JSDoc-documented)

Source: https://github.com/resend/resend-node/blob/canary/src/emails/interfaces/create-email-options.interface.ts

The most comprehensively documented interface in the SDK. Every parameter (attachments, bcc, cc, from, headers, replyTo, subject, tags, to, topicId, scheduledAt, react, html, text) has JSDoc descriptions with links to the Resend API docs.

```typescript
interface CreateEmailBaseOptions {
  /**
   * Filename and content of attachments (max 40mb per email)
   *
   * @link https://resend.com/docs/api-reference/emails/send-email#body-parameters
   */
  attachments?: Attachment[];
  /**
   * Blind carbon copy recipient email address. For multiple addresses, send as an array of strings.
   *
   * @link https://resend.com/docs/api-reference/emails/send-email#body-parameters
   */
  bcc?: string | string[];
  /**
   * Carbon copy recipient email address. For multiple addresses, send as an array of strings.
   *
   * @link https://resend.com/docs/api-reference/emails/send-email#body-parameters
   */
  cc?: string | string[];
  /**
   * Sender email address. To include a friendly name, use the format `"Your Name <sender@domain.com>"`
   *
   * @link https://resend.com/docs/api-reference/emails/send-email#body-parameters
   */
  from: string;
  /**
   * Custom headers to add to the email.
   *
   * @link https://resend.com/docs/api-reference/emails/send-email#body-parameters
   */
  headers?: Record<string, string>;
  /**
   * Reply-to email address. For multiple addresses, send as an array of strings.
   *
   * @link https://resend.com/docs/api-reference/emails/send-email#body-parameters
   */
  replyTo?: string | string[];
  /**
   * Email subject.
   *
   * @link https://resend.com/docs/api-reference/emails/send-email#body-parameters
   */
  subject: string;
  /**
   * Email tags
   *
   * @link https://resend.com/docs/api-reference/emails/send-email#body-parameters
   */
  tags?: Tag[];
  /**
   * Recipient email address. For multiple addresses, send as an array of strings. Max 50.
   *
   * @link https://resend.com/docs/api-reference/emails/send-email#body-parameters
   */
  to: string | string[];
  /**
   * The id of the topic you want to send to
   *
   * @link https://resend.com/docs/api-reference/emails/send-email#body-parameters
   */
  topicId?: string | null;
  /**
   * Schedule email to be sent later.
   * The date should be in ISO 8601 format (e.g: 2024-08-05T11:52:01.858Z).
   *
   * @link https://resend.com/docs/api-reference/emails/send-email#body-parameters
   */
  scheduledAt?: string;
}
```

